WEBVTT

00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.070
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.840
Go! Shock!!

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:38.180
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.020
Friends who share the same future

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.720
With you guys

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:46.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:49.390
If we join forces

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.360
We’ll be invincible

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:02.870
Delicious food gives life

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:09.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.080
Let’s eat!!

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:14.020
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.150
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:22.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.330
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:33.070
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:35.940
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:39.940
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:42.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:50.290
Someone once said...

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.520
With a body made out of a china bowl,

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:57.760
and its legs made out of 
wonderfully-textured udon noodles,

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.400
it drifts in the sea just like a jellyfish...

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:05.330
Udon Jellyfish!

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:10.270
The smell is a little hard 
to take, but it tastes sweet.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:14.710
It's a stingray with a first-rate 
durian fruit growing on its tail...

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:20.350
Stingdurian!

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:21.680
Stingdurian, by Yuma-san 
of Saitama Prefecture!

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:23.550
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:28.760
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:32.590
In order to capture Bubble Fruit,

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.730
Toriko and Komatsu devoted themselves 
to Honor the Food training.

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:40.670
Their training tasks were mundane, 
but the results were tremendous.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:47.470
Eventually, you'll be able to produce 
skills with even more explosive power

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:50.980
just by blinking an eye or breathing.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:54.110
But to do that, you require more training.

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:58.680
Alright, Komatsu! Let's keep training 
and master Honoring the Food!

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:00.790
Right, Toriko-san!

00:03:00.790 --> 00:03:04.760
Meanwhile, Master Chin had a 
premonition of an approaching threat

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:07.560
and began to make preparations.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:15.030
Approaching Threat! Hurry, Toriko! 
The Path to the Bubble Fruit!

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:56.470
Something's coming...

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.250
Marvelous improvement!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:15.290
They can keep the flames of ten Torch 
Horsetails going for two hours!

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.730
Alright. You're finished.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:23.130
We've gotten to where we can really 
relax while showing appreciation, huh?

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:27.740
Yeah. I feel like I could've kept up 
the Food Meditation for another hour.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.150
Incredible...

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:49.350
My wasted movements are gone,

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:52.290
while my skill's speed and 
power have totally increased.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.360
Now it's my turn.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.370
Enamel Cabbage shredding!

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.570
Look at how fine I can cut it now!

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:13.710
Impressive!

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:16.240
Thank you for the food.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:22.310
It's thin and springy with a silky texture.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.720
Delicious!

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:27.520
Oh, my, Toriko-san, Komatsu-san...

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.150
Your progress has been remarkable.

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:33.760
I never imagined you two would make 
Honoring the Food your own this quickly.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:37.800
I'm sure I wouldn't be able 
to win against you two now.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.400
Then it's time to move on to 
the advanced course, right?

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.830
We've gotta pass the final test and fast!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.800
That isn't necessary.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:48.170
You've already been doing the 
advanced training course.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.710
Say what?!

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:52.310
And the ingredients we'd have 
you eat in the final test, too,

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:54.280
you've already eaten them 
during your training.

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:57.880
In other words, you two have already 
mastered Honoring the Food.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.820
That's correct!

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.070
Master Chin!

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:34.780
Um... What were your names again?

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.750
I don't believe this!

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.790
Now you won't even take a guess?!

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:40.960
They're Toriko-san and Komatsu-san.

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.490
Oh, yes. That's right.

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.430
That's what I thought.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:47.260
Really?!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.410
Congratulations on your training thus far.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.380
Perhaps I should praise you for 
completing it faster than I expected.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:08.080
Although I'll need to be compensated 
for that building you destroyed.

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:14.720
Well, anyway, from this point on, 
I'll be training you directly.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.290
Alright!

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.090
We did it!

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:22.300
Follow me, Tommy Lee George and Colin Farrow.

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:25.670
That's not it! In fact, those 
names are harder to remember!

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:31.810
Your goal was this Bubble Fruit, wasn't it?

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:33.910
First, try to take one.

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:36.610
We're starting with the Bubble Fruit?!

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.190
Well, go.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.220
Toriko-san...

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:48.620
Y-Yeah...

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:52.760
Let's go, Komatsu.

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:53.390
Right.

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:05.810
The Bubble Fruit...

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:08.210
It's not disappearing!

00:09:12.210 --> 00:09:15.850
I can touch it! This is Bubble Fruit!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.150
Yes! We did it!

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:21.090
But this is...

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.960
Now I know, after touching it.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.890
This isn't an ingredient!

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:30.630
The inside is empty. It's just 
a regular old delicate bubble!

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.930
That's right!

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:39.270
I made these for training, to practice 
with before attempting the real thing.

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:40.670
For training?

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:43.610
Then where's the real Bubble Fruit?

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.410
We're on our way to get them now.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:51.720
That will be my one and 
only training exercise.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:57.520
Good luck. The hardest part is before you.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:00.960
Shu-san, thank you for everything.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.160
I appreciate it.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:07.030
All I did was draw out the 
true power that you possess.

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.700
Now try not to get yourselves killed.

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:11.470
The master is a hard taskmaster.

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:13.940
R-Really?

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.310
Even though our training up to 
now has been plenty tough...

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:19.410
Shunaida...

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:20.540
It's Shu.

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:23.010
While I'm out,

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:27.120
gather together all of the 
other assistant instructors.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:31.150
So that no matter what happens at the 
temple, you'll all be able to handle it.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:07.520
W-What is this?!

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:11.090
A path made of bubbles, 
commonly called "Bubble Way".

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:12.660
Bubble Way...

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:19.430
This is the only path that leads to 
the temple's treasure, Bubble Fruit.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.910
It really is made of bubbles!

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:27.980
You need to patiently walk straight ahead.

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:29.780
That's the training.

00:11:30.650 --> 00:11:31.680
That's it?!

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:36.120
That's right. If you get past this 
and capture the Bubble Fruit,

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.950
it means you'll have mastered a 
gourmet secret technique, too.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:40.590
Are you sure?!

00:11:41.120 --> 00:11:45.590
However, only one of you can walk this path.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.470
You see, the Bubble Fruit 
is a super-shy ingredient.

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:55.740
It knows me, but is willing to accept 
only one other person in its presence.

00:11:57.200 --> 00:12:02.940
Moreover, it's very jealous so you 
can't bring other ingredients with you.

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:06.910
So it wants to be the only ingredient 
that's looked at and eaten, huh?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:07.850
Indeed.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:10.250
Interesting!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:11.620
I'll go!

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:14.550
Komatsu, wait here.

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:17.520
Okay. I'll get ready to cook as I wait.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.730
Then shall we go?

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.400
Do your best!

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:28.330
Thanks. But it's just walking. 
It'll be a piece of cake.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:31.240
Toriko-san, good luck!

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.470
"Piece of cake", yeah, right.

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:37.680
An incredibly strong Beast? 
Disastrous weather?

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:40.610
What kind of trials are waiting for me?

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.030
This is deep training,

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:02.230
in which you learn to show inexhaustible 
appreciation towards food.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.740
And will I really master a 
secret technique this way?

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.270
Food's End.

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:11.440
Food's End?

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:12.540
What the heck is that?

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:17.080
It's when you're completely 
immersed in your meal.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:19.180
It's a secret technique

00:13:19.180 --> 00:13:24.460
that only someone who appreciates food 
to the umpteenth degree can master.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:27.290
Immersing yourself in a meal 
is a secret technique?!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:29.660
I always do that!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:31.360
The depth is different.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.730
Yours are only meals.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:37.100
Food's End, huh?

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.070
A Beast?!

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:19.810
Once we're out of this cave, is there 
gonna be crazy weather waitin' for me?

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:34.360
It's long!

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:37.560
We're not at the end of 
this bubble path yet?!

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.760
There's still a ways to go.

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:48.140
No Beasts?

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:50.240
No wild weather?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.910
How far does this damn path go?

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.880
No, more than that...

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:06.790
There's nothin'!

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:09.960
Not even any plants or water!

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.160
It really is just a path of bubbles!

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:17.900
Come on. We're not there yet.

00:15:18.630 --> 00:15:21.300
Don't tell me this is

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:22.740
the training?!

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.410
You need to master

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:27.610
Food's End.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:32.080
Hurry. I must get back soon myself.

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:48.490
The Lost Forest is drying 
up at an incredible rate.

00:15:48.490 --> 00:15:52.500
I believe it must be the work of 
something dreadful beyond imagination.

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.100
It sounds like something extremely 
unpleasant is going to happen.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.200
And right now, the master is on Bubble Way.

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.440
Wagon-san...

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:05.080
So we'll have to deal with 
it until he gets back.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:10.320
S-So just when are we gonna get there?

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.720
Oh, I'm sure we'll arrive before too long.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:17.360
"Before too long"... We've been 
walking for about a week, haven't we?

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:21.990
Huh. So that's how long 
it's been for you, eh?

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:32.600
No water, no food...

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.610
I've hit my physical limit.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.280
Hey, Master...

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:43.350
About how many people have reached 
Bubble Fruit in the past?

00:16:43.880 --> 00:16:46.050
Oh, there have been several,

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:49.490
but the last one was the leader 
of the Gourmet Knights,

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:51.090
Baldmaru.

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.460
Baldmaru?

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.190
You mean Aimaru?

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.960
Yes, that's it! Aimaru.

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:58.600
He wasn't bald.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.470
So Ai successfully completed this training?

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:04.200
Yeah. In just a few days.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:09.270
That's because Gourmet 
Knights are used to fasting.

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:11.370
I can't let him beat me!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:15.610
Ai will make fun of me! There's 
no way I'm gonna lose!

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.940
How?

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:45.470
How can the master walk normally like that

00:17:45.470 --> 00:17:49.180
after going without eating 
or drinking for days?

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:53.520
And it looks like he 
hasn't lost any weight...

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:56.690
Maybe I'll give you just the answer first.

00:17:57.850 --> 00:18:00.590
You can't tell by looking at me,

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:04.760
but right now, my weight is close to one ton.

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:07.230
One ton?! That's ridiculous!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.260
How can that small body be so heavy?!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.840
This is the result of the 
secret technique, Food's End!

00:18:19.970 --> 00:18:23.480
Even without doing anything, I can 
survive like this for several months

00:18:23.480 --> 00:18:25.910
without eating or drinking anything.

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:32.320
Through Food's End, I've stored up 
a great deal of food in my body.

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:39.490
I go beyond my body's limit and 
take in great quantities of food.

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:43.730
I can charge up my body with 
the energy from the food I ate.

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:46.770
It's a secret technique that can be activated

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.170
only when you're seriously 
immersed in a meal.

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:51.740
There's no shortcut to mastering it.

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:56.440
Like with this path, endless thoughts 
of gratitude are necessary.

00:18:56.940 --> 00:19:00.410
Nothing but appreciation.

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:03.850
If you do that, the temple 
treasure will appear.

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:07.590
Everyone, escape!

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:10.560
Leave this to us!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.590
Go on, hurry!

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:15.890
Someone who possesses incredible 
power is closing in on us!

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:18.060
Get out of here now!

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.900
Assistant instructor! We'll fight, too!

00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:23.140
This temple has done a lot for us!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:25.870
That's right! We have an obligation to 
pay it back for teaching us gratitude!

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:29.240
We won't let anyone lay a 
finger on Chowlin Temple!

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:32.680
Good grief...

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:40.990
I wonder if Toriko-san has 
reached the Bubble Fruit.

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:43.550
Well, I'd better get prepared.

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:48.790
Chowlin Temple...

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.530
It's trying to hide?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.040
What the hell is that?!

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:08.750
We're here!

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:20.360
The forest and temple 
made of SycnomoreTrees...

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.760
They're as cowardly as ever!

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:27.300
Show yourself!

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:37.370
What?!

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:39.440
Her threat has forced them 
to show their true forms.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:50.550
Oh, no...

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:52.320
S-She's...

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:03.730
Well, well. Everyone's certainly 
bettered themselves.

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:05.670
C-Chiyo-san?!

00:21:13.270 --> 00:21:18.710
Under our feet, over our heads

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:26.550
The world is spinning

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:31.860
A dream flower

00:21:32.890 --> 00:21:35.460
Is blooming, blooming

00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:42.570
Tell me the rest, come on

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:46.570
Lead me by the hand

00:21:46.510 --> 00:21:49.740
And take me with you

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:57.180
Don't leave me here alone

00:21:57.550 --> 00:22:00.850
Red shoes

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:04.620
I can't take off

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:15.840
I'm the only one dancing

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:20.870
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:25.340
Yun is hiding somewhere in the image 
you're about to see, so please find him!

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:32.220
Hiding Level
10

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:28.080
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 10!

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:30.280
The allotted time limit is 15 seconds!

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:32.220
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:37.120
So where is Yun on Bubble Way, 
the path of purely bubbles?

00:22:37.360 --> 00:22:39.120
It's a difficult one this time.

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:42.260
For those of you who still don't 
know, I'll give you a one-gram hint!

00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:45.400
The middle area of the 
screen may be suspicious...

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:48.130
Yun is... right here!

00:22:52.370 --> 00:22:56.510
With Yun's mimic coloring, this was 
the perfect place for him to hide!

00:22:56.870 --> 00:23:00.210
Well, how is training on 
Bubble Way going to turn out?

00:23:00.210 --> 00:23:02.510
And will Chowlin Temple be okay?!

00:23:02.510 --> 00:23:04.380
Take a look at this next segment!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.650
Toriko, get up!

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:12.620
Everyone is waiting for you... including Komatsu-kun!

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:16.190
Tragedy! The End of Chowlin Temple! Farewell, Komatsu!

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:18.770
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
